{"reviews":[{"id":"B09HSQCVQC-0","r":4.0,"t":"good product","x":"Was kind of skeptical with this product because I have never used this brand. Overall it worked really well! The only problem I had was that when i first opened the bottle it was thick. I was painting my nails in the sunlight and the product was drying before i put them under my lamp. It was also thick and peeling off while i was adding more coats. I moved out of the sunlight and it was painting on normal. (the picture on my review in my nails with 3-4 coats of product!) thanks for reading \ud83d\ude0a","h":10,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2022"},{"id":"B09HSQCVQC-1","r":5.0,"t":"New favorite gel polish","x":"This is my new favorite gel polish! It\u2019s a beautiful thin sheet pink, but it\u2019s also buildable. One coat makes your nails look nice and healthy. I did about 3 coats to get it this color of pink. I would definitely repurchase.","h":6,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2020"},{"id":"B09HSQCVQC-2","r":5.0,"t":"Kind of thick","x":"[[VIDEOID:d70dd82ae993acc5bb97ff43bc43a9ea]] Very pretty polish. It\u2019s a little thick I used GELISH base & top coat and 2 THIN !!!!! coats of the sheer pink polish then added my cuticle oil after curing in LED lamp. Def would recommend \ud83d\ude00","h":5,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2022"},{"id":"B09HSQCVQC-3","r":1.0,"t":"Too sheer","x":"Not milky enough \ud83d\ude29 way too sheer for milk bat nails. I added a few drops of white gel polish to make it work","h":5,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2020"},{"id":"B09HSQCVQC-4","r":5.0,"t":"This kind of color it is always kinda difficult to put on, but this brand it is AWESOME!","x":"[[VIDEOID:21b780da4b5208788a716f92e008c0a1]] Classy and so easy to use since this color it\u2019s not easy to apply.","h":4,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2022"},{"id":"B09HSQCVQC-5","r":5.0,"t":"Finally!!!","x":"I finally found the perfect milky white polish! Highly recommend!","h":4,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2022"},{"id":"B09HSQCVQC-6","r":5.0,"t":"INHYPE soak off UV gel nailpolish review:","x":"INHYPE soak off UV gel nail polish review: works great even with my shaky hands. The consistency of this polish is more like regular nail polish. This color is a very sheer pink and it looks really natural it would be great for American French or any French nails","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2020"},{"id":"B09HSQCVQC-7","r":5.0,"t":"Good product!","x":"It is exactly what I was looking for, pink yet translucent!","h":3,"v":1,"d":"May 2020"},{"id":"B09HSQCVQC-8","r":5.0,"t":"Nice subtle milky pink color","x":"I like it.  I put 1 coat on my fingers nails and 2 coats on my toes.  The 2 coats comes out more pink.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2021"},{"id":"B09HSQCVQC-9","r":5.0,"t":"Good jelly pink!","x":"It a super great nail polish! I applied three coats to get a jelly pink","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2020"},{"id":"B09HSQCVQC-10","r":4.0,"t":"Pretty, buildable, streaky?","x":"This polish is exactly the color I wanted, amd is buildable, making it easy to create a gradient effect. The only thing is it cures a little streaky, making it almost have a rose quartz effect, which is cool of that's something your into. Lol but if you are looking for an opaque even look, this probably will fall short.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2020"},{"id":"B09HSQCVQC-11","r":5.0,"t":"Finally a nice milky white!!!","x":"I been looking for a hood milky white color and other 3 brands I purchased were not really a white but more of a sheer creamy color. This color is more white and the color is perfect and exactly what I was looking for at 4 coats.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2021"},{"id":"B09HSQCVQC-12","r":5.0,"t":"Perfect","x":"This is exactly what I was looking for. Pretty sheer pink. Perfect for French manicure or as a finish tinted over another color. Full sized bottle will last a while. I would definitely recommend.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2020"},{"id":"B09HSQCVQC-13","r":5.0,"t":"Good purchase","x":"I like to buy my own gels and take them to my manicurist. That way I can fix cracks or chips at home in between manicures this color is pretty and it was pretty durable.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2023"},{"id":"B09HSQCVQC-14","r":1.0,"t":"Wrong color...","x":"Color is nothing like what was described and Is not translucent at all. I don\u2019t know if I was shipped the wrong product or if it was just severely miss-marketed....","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2020"},{"id":"B09HSQCVQC-15","r":1.0,"t":"Not impressed","x":"Very disappointed that I was given the wrong color completely!! Wish I knew how good the product itself is but I won\u2019t wear this color","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2020"},{"id":"B09HSQCVQC-16","r":5.0,"t":"Perfect French polish","x":"If you\u2019re looking a pink base for French tip, this is it. The more coats you add the more cover pink you get !","h":1,"v":1,"d":"May 2022"},{"id":"B09HSQCVQC-17","r":5.0,"t":"Just what I was looking for!","x":"Love the color and it goes on really nice! It's great for french manicures which is what I got it for. :)","h":1,"v":1,"d":"May 2020"},{"id":"B09HSQCVQC-18","r":5.0,"t":"milky pink","x":"This polish is great. It comes on just as it shows in the pictures. Add more coats for a deeper color.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2020"},{"id":"B09HSQCVQC-19","r":2.0,"t":"Couldn't get it to cure","x":"Love the color but I couldn't get it to cure properly and I haven't had any trouble with other gels.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2020"},{"id":"B09HSQCVQC-20","r":4.0,"t":"Less pigment","x":"Not as pigmented as I thought. You have to add a few layers to get the color in the picture.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2021"},{"id":"B09HSQCVQC-21","r":5.0,"t":"Color perfection","x":"Love the color of this polish, a soft milky/jelly white. Perfect for year round.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2021"},{"id":"B09HSQCVQC-22","r":5.0,"t":"Love it!","x":"Beautiful nude. Good quality as well! Would definitely recommend!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2021"},{"id":"B09HSQCVQC-23","r":1.0,"t":"Clear Not Pink","x":"The color doesnt show on the nail. I put 4 coats on.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2020"},{"id":"B09HSQCVQC-24","r":2.0,"t":"Chunky and doesn\u2019t look anything like the picture.","x":"Judging by the picture this is exactly what I wanted my nails to look like. I used this product thinking that\u2019s what would happen but instead it peels off with no effort and it requires so many coats for it to even look like this. It had some bad chunks inside the bottle that transferred to my nails and it was really gross like it was expired or something. I\u2019m hoping this was just a bad batch but I really was hoping for nails the way the picture looked. Sadly disappointed.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2022"}],"emb":"","summary":{"claims":[{"text":"Many reviewers describe the color as a pretty, sheer pink that looks natural and works well for French manicures or layering.","cites":[2,7,8,9,13]},{"text":"Several reviewers note the polish is buildable, requiring multiple coats to achieve the desired color or jelly effect.","cites":[2,9,10,11,12]},{"text":"Some reviewers find the polish too thick or prone to drying/streaky application.","cites":[1,3,11]},{"text":"A few reviewers say the polish is too sheer or not milky/translucent enough for their expectations.","cites":[4,15]},{"text":"Multiple reviewers praise it as the perfect milky white or milky pink they had been searching for.","cites":[6,12]}]},"qa":[]}